WEBVTT

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:30.796
Futures that we write first as neighbors

00:01:30.836 --> 00:01:32.596
and then as a movement.

00:01:32.636 --> 00:01:34.396
We are coming together,

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:36.116
choosing what comes next

00:01:36.156 --> 00:01:38.516
and refusing to accept defeat.

00:01:39.276 --> 00:01:40.516
There is hope.

00:01:42.756 --> 00:01:45.676
Transforming our world
to address the climate crisis

00:01:45.716 --> 00:01:48.116
isn’t just urgent and necessary;

00:01:48.116 --> 00:01:50.836
it is possible, already underway

00:01:50.956 --> 00:01:52.756
and leading us to a better future.

00:01:53.116 --> 00:01:54.796
Countdown is a global initiative

00:01:54.836 --> 00:01:58.316
to champion and accelerate solutions
to the climate crisis,

00:01:58.996 --> 00:02:01.116
to turn ideas into action.